    "body": "claimed: Codex (m3) · 2026-11-27T17:29:32Z · branch mkinney:issue/4399-clippy-main · plan: run clippy on upstream/main, fix the clippy warnings that make the post-merge gate red.\n\n<!-- ownership: writer -->\nOwner: mkinney / m3 pool job issue-4399\nDispatcher: mkinney / m3 pool\nIssue: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/4399\nPR: not yet open\nBranch: mkinney/Camcraft issue/4399-clippy-main\nBase: NeoTech/Camcraft main 751a79b20327fa73743f032f2f3d99907334cbe3\nStarting head: 751a79b20327fa73743f032f2f3d99907334cbe3\nExpected remote: absent\nStarted: 2026-11-27T17:29:32Z\nState: active\n",
